# ── Firebase / GCP service-account credentials ────────────────────────────────
# Target the credential files specifically. This used to be a blanket `*.json`
# with a four-entry allowlist, which silently ignored every new JSON added to the
# project — a tsconfig, an extra Firebase config, a fixture — and the omission
# only ever surfaced as something missing in a deploy.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
serviceAccount*.json
service-account*.json
gcp-credentials*.json
*-credentials.json

